    for(const id of ["impactFeedbackIntensity","impactFeedbackFlash","impactFeedbackShake","impactFeedbackIgnoreReducedMotion","impactFeedbackMediumDv","impactFeedbackHeavyDv","impactPreviewLight","impactPreviewMedium","impactPreviewHeavy"])mget(id).disabled=!settings.impactFeedbackEnabled;
